OL,4,T]W-,,%-,,%-,,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,6, SDP leader Dr David Owen has said the
OL,7, Alliance must have an agreed defence
OL,8, policy before the next general election
OL,10,FHe told the Liberal assembly in
OL,11,FHarrogate the Alliance had to make some
OL,12,Ftough, short-term decisions on the
OL,13,Fdeployment of American cruise missiles
OL,14,Fin Britain.
OL,16,FDr Owen echoed Mr Steel's views that
OL,17,Foptions on an anti-cruise stance should
OL,18,Fbe left open.
OL,20,FBut he warned that Labour's non-nuclear
OL,21,Fstance had cost them millions of voters
OL,22,Fin the last general election.
OL,23,                      D]CFromG24-09-83
