OL,5,B
OL,6, Five chemical firm executives have been
OL,7, jailed in connection with the Italian
OL,8, chemical explosion at Seveso in 1973.
OL,9,B
OL,10,BTheir sentences range from 30 months to
OL,11,Bfive years.
OL,12,B
OL,13,BSeveso, a town north of Milan, was
OL,14,Bsprayed with toxic chemicals after a
OL,15,Bblast in the plant of the Swiss firm.
OL,16,B
OL,17,BThe pollution - caused by the chemical
OL,18,Bdioxin - caused skin diseases and the
OL,19,Bforced evacuation of 800 inhabitants.
OL,20,BSeveral women underwent voluntary
OL,21,Babortions fearing malformed children.
OL,22,B
OL,23,T]CFromG24-09-83C  teletextarchive.com
