OL,5,B
OL,6, Heavy fighting is continuing in the
OL,7, Lebanese capital of Beirut.
OL,8,B
OL,9,BThe fighting - in a Shi'ite moslem area
OL,10,B- came after a night of disturbances.
OL,11,B
OL,12,BLebanese army and United States marine
OL,13,Bpositions on the southern outskirts of
OL,14,BBeirut came under heavy fire, prompting
OL,15,Bships of the US navy lying off the
OL,16,Bcapital to open fire.
OL,17,B
OL,18,BThe battle coincided with news that
OL,19,BSyria had demanded changes to a planned
OL,20,Bceasefire agreement, which were
OL,21,Bunacceptable to Lebanon.
OL,22,B
OL,23,T]CFromG24-09-83C  teletextarchive.com
